  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 16 November 2005 it was unable to grant the Certificate of Lawful Development for the erection of roof extension, incorporating a hip to gable conversion and a rear roof extension because the annotated dimensions do not match the scale of the drawings and some of the dimensions required have not been annotated. The rear roof extension scales three different sizes on the three different elevations. \r\nIn the absence of accurate drawings the authority is unable to determine whether the proposals would give rise to a development within the confines of domestic permitted development rights, as defined in the General Permitted Development Order 1995.\r\n"
